## ObjectType: Customer

Enterprise account managed by a sales representative.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| customer_id | Customer ID | string | Unique customer code | customer_id |
| name | Customer Name | string | Legal display name | name |
| tier | Customer Tier | string | Standard, growth, or VIP | tier |
| region | Region | string | Commercial region | region |
| rep_id | Sales Rep ID | string | Assigned representative | rep_id |
| credit_limit | Credit Limit | decimal | Approved credit limit | credit_limit |

